src/shared/audio/opl.zig
------------------------

The FM synthesiser is a translation into Zig of the OPL2/OPL3 emulation library of DOSBox 0.73
(`src/hardware/opl.cpp`, Ken Silverman's ADLIBEMU lineage). The algorithm, the tables and the
arithmetic are that library's; the translation is a derivative work of it and carries its
licence.

